   "zh": "8月31日、9月1日分别是吉尔吉斯斯坦和乌兹别克斯坦独立35周年纪念日。借此机会，谨向扎帕罗夫总统、米尔济约耶夫总统，向友好的吉尔吉斯斯坦人民和乌兹别克斯坦人民，表示诚挚的祝贺！",
   "en": "August 31 and September 1 mark the 35th anniversaries of the independence of Kyrgyzstan and Uzbekistan. I wish to extend our heartfelt congratulations to President Zhaparov, President Shavkat Mirziyoyev, and to the friendly people of Kyrgyzstan and Uzbekistan.",
